('advanced-native-1038', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-1038-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["The fixed sheet assumed a shared job history that the new participants did not have."],"options":["The sheet covered several occupations, but the tutor wanted the group to focus on factory work alone.","All new participants had the same factory experience assumed in the questions.","The tutor had asked the group to keep the sheet unchanged for the new task.","The fixed sheet assumed a shared job history that the new participants did not have."]},"advanced-native-1038-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["Our previous assumptions no longer cover the people taking part.","We need questions that respond to the range of experience now present.","The speakers have different occupations, so the shared-factory questions do not fit everyone.","We are using yesterday’s tools because the fixed questions assume a work history these speakers do not share."],"options":["Our previous assumptions no longer cover the people taking part.","We need questions that respond to the range of experience now present.","The speakers have different occupations, so the shared-factory questions do not fit everyone.","We are using yesterday’s tools because the fixed questions assume a work history these speakers do not share."]},"advanced-native-1038-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["We are using yesterday’s tools for this tracking task; let us keep the name field and add owners, dates and return status."],"options":["The form already records owners, dates and return status in separate fields.","We are using yesterday’s tools for this tracking task; let us keep the name field and add owners, dates and return status.","We can solve the tracking problem by copying the name-only form more neatly without adding fields."]},"advanced-native-1038-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["Every old method is useless simply because it is old."],"options":["The context should identify a practical mismatch.","An older approach may not meet a current need.","Every old method is useless simply because it is old."]},"advanced-native-1038-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["Relying on the factory assumptions would mean using yesterday’s tools here; we can keep the open questions and adapt the rest."],"options":["Relying on the factory assumptions would mean using yesterday’s tools here; we can keep the open questions and adapt the rest.","We should retain every factory question because the sheet once worked.","We should remove the useful questions too before considering what the new participants need."]},"advanced-native-1038-v1-final":{"type":"open","answers":["We are using yesterday’s tools when the guide relies on “to your left” but viewers can only see the camera frame. We should describe visible features and pause for questions instead.","We are using yesterday’s tools when the script assumes everyone can look around the room. Let us rebuild the explanation around what the remote viewers can actually see."],"options":[]}}'::jsonb),
('advanced-native-1039', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-1039-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["Similar titles required extra checking to match recordings and transcripts."],"options":["Similar titles required extra checking to match recordings and transcripts.","The titles clearly distinguished all three files without further work.","The team needed to repair the sound quality before anyone could hear a voice.","The transcripts were clearly matched, but the team wanted to rename them for a new display."]},"advanced-native-1039-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["The naming problem added a verification step before the materials could be linked.","Three files had similar titles, so we had to compare the voices and notes.","The unlabelled files were a real headache because they could not be matched by title alone.","We needed more than the filenames to find the right transcripts."],"options":["The naming problem added a verification step before the materials could be linked.","Three files had similar titles, so we had to compare the voices and notes.","The unlabelled files were a real headache because they could not be matched by title alone.","We needed more than the filenames to find the right transcripts."]},"advanced-native-1039-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["The separate bookings have become a logistical headache, and we need to compare the times together."],"options":["The bookings have already been combined into one confirmed timetable.","The only remaining task is to print the already agreed pickup list.","The separate bookings have become a logistical headache, and we need to compare the times together."]},"advanced-native-1039-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["The speaker is necessarily describing physical head pain."],"options":["The context may explain the added practical burden.","Something is troublesome to deal with.","The speaker is necessarily describing physical head pain."]},"advanced-native-1039-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["It is a real headache, but we still have material to check; let us describe the extra work rather than call the project impossible."],"options":["Let us match the first title that looks close and leave the voice check until after publication.","It is a real headache, but we still have material to check; let us describe the extra work rather than call the project impossible.","Let us postpone the entire project before comparing the voices with the notes."]},"advanced-native-1039-v1-final":{"type":"open","answers":["The different sign-up lists have become a real headache now that people are changing groups. Could we compare them and agree on one current list before making further changes?","It is a logistical headache rather than a reason to blame one person. Let us check which entries are current and ask about uncertain changes before removing any names."],"options":[]}}'::jsonb),
('advanced-native-1040', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-1040-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["Many online demands occupied the evenings, not a physically full room."],"options":["The project chats happened after the busy week rather than during it.","The online sessions were brief updates that the speaker described as leaving most evenings free.","Many online demands occupied the evenings, not a physically full room.","The speaker had arranged the calls and chats on separate evenings, leaving one activity per night."]},"advanced-native-1040-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["It felt digitally crowded because many online activities competed for my evening time.","Being alone physically did not remove the overlapping online demands.","The amount of contact and information filled the available evenings.","The same evenings held lessons, family calls and several project chats."],"options":["It felt digitally crowded because many online activities competed for my evening time.","Being alone physically did not remove the overlapping online demands.","The amount of contact and information filled the available evenings.","The same evenings held lessons, family calls and several project chats."]},"advanced-native-1040-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["The digitally crowded discussion needs a clear place for current decisions rather than more versions in separate chats."],"options":["The digitally crowded discussion needs a clear place for current decisions rather than more versions in separate chats.","The change was simply that more people joined the original group; no extra channels were created.","Each separate chat is already repeating the same agreed final version, so nobody needs to compare updates."]},"advanced-native-1040-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["A room must contain many people physically."],"options":["A room must contain many people physically.","The phrase can describe an experience rather than a measured universal limit.","Online information or activity feels densely packed."]},"advanced-native-1040-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["The week was digitally crowded even in a quiet room; let us look at the overlapping activities, not just who was beside me."],"options":["The project chats were spread over different weeks, leaving those evenings mostly free.","I had already moved the family calls to the daytime before that busy week began.","The week was digitally crowded even in a quiet room; let us look at the overlapping activities, not just who was beside me."]},"advanced-native-1040-v1-final":{"type":"open","answers":["The home page feels digitally crowded, and the photo-submission link is hard to find. Let us give that link one clear position and move the other activities to a separate page.","We can make the digitally crowded page easier to use without deleting the old activities. A clear submission button and a separate activity list would preserve both access and information."],"options":[]}}'::jsonb),
('advanced-native-1041', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-1041-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["They discussed the actual space together, then recorded what they agreed."],"options":["They agreed before checking which part of the doorway was in dispute.","They discussed the actual space together, then recorded what they agreed.","They only exchanged separate text messages without meeting.","The face-to-face meeting removed any need to record the final agreement."]},"advanced-native-1041-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["We had interpreted the same space differently and needed to point it out together.","A face-to-face conversation helped us connect the wording with the doorway itself.","Meeting in the room let us clarify the area the notes referred to.","We could discuss the physical space directly before writing down the agreement."],"options":["We had interpreted the same space differently and needed to point it out together.","A face-to-face conversation helped us connect the wording with the doorway itself.","Meeting in the room let us clarify the area the notes referred to.","We could discuss the physical space directly before writing down the agreement."]},"advanced-native-1041-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["Would a face-to-face conversation at the weekend help us discuss the different endings?"],"options":["Let us settle the ending through separate comments tonight without offering the weekend meeting.","I will announce a weekend meeting to the rest of the group before checking whether you want one.","Would a face-to-face conversation at the weekend help us discuss the different endings?"]},"advanced-native-1041-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["They are guaranteed to agree by the end."],"options":["People are communicating directly while physically together.","They are guaranteed to agree by the end.","The purpose can determine whether a written follow-up is useful."]},"advanced-native-1041-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["The face-to-face conversation clarified the space, and a written note can help the next group follow what we agreed."],"options":["Let us tell the next group only that we met, leaving the layout details out of the handover.","We can send the next group our original disputed notes instead of writing the clarified agreement.","The face-to-face conversation clarified the space, and a written note can help the next group follow what we agreed."]},"advanced-native-1041-v1-final":{"type":"open","answers":["A face-to-face conversation in the shop would be welcome, and I will respect your wish not to be filmed. May I take notes and send you the quotations to check afterwards?","We can have a face-to-face conversation without making a video. Please tell me whether written notes and a later quotation check would be acceptable to you."],"options":[]}}'::jsonb),
('advanced-native-1042', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-1042-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["More time to compare dates, while the opening date and confirmation need remained."],"options":["More time to compare dates, while the opening date and confirmation need remained.","The extension settled which disputed date was correct.","The opening date moved by the same extra week as the verification deadline.","The extension was given for redesigning the display rather than comparing the conflicting dates."]},"advanced-native-1042-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["We could plan the verification before the unchanged opening date.","We had time to compare the conflicting dates more carefully.","It gave us breathing space without deciding the disputed entry for us.","The short extension relieved immediate pressure while leaving a clear task to finish."],"options":["We could plan the verification before the unchanged opening date.","We had time to compare the conflicting dates more carefully.","It gave us breathing space without deciding the disputed entry for us.","The short extension relieved immediate pressure while leaving a clear task to finish."]},"advanced-native-1042-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["The agreed pause gives them breathing space before they discuss the notes tomorrow."],"options":["The pause confirms that they have already agreed about the disagreement.","They will continue arguing tonight before either has read the other’s notes.","The agreed pause gives them breathing space before they discuss the notes tomorrow."]},"advanced-native-1042-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["The underlying problem has already disappeared."],"options":["Pressure is relieved for a period.","The underlying problem has already disappeared.","The time can be used to consider what to do next."]},"advanced-native-1042-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["The extension gives us breathing space, so let us use it to verify the entry before the fixed opening."],"options":["Let us move the verification to after the opening and use the extra week only on the display design.","We can treat the extra time as a decision to remove the disputed entry without checking it.","The extension gives us breathing space, so let us use it to verify the entry before the fixed opening."]},"advanced-native-1042-v1-final":{"type":"open","answers":["We should leave ten minutes of breathing space between the workshops so participants can rest or note a question. The break can be optional time of their own before the next session starts on schedule.","A short break would give everyone breathing room after the first workshop. Let us keep it free of required activities while making the next starting time clear."],"options":[]}}'::jsonb),
('advanced-native-1043', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-1043-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["They began talking about their lives again, beyond the collection arrangements."],"options":["They had already been sharing the same personal stories regularly before the lunches began.","The lunches replaced collection messages with a new set of written delivery instructions.","They stopped exchanging messages but had not yet begun spending time together.","They began talking about their lives again, beyond the collection arrangements."]},"advanced-native-1043-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["They have recovered some personal conversation that their changed shifts had made less common.","Meeting regularly has given them a chance to reconnect beyond practical messages.","They now ask about each other’s lives instead of only organising collections.","The lunches helped them regain a little more genuine human contact after their conversations had narrowed to arrangements."],"options":["They have recovered some personal conversation that their changed shifts had made less common.","Meeting regularly has given them a chance to reconnect beyond practical messages.","They now ask about each other’s lives instead of only organising collections.","The lunches helped them regain a little more genuine human contact after their conversations had narrowed to arrangements."]},"advanced-native-1043-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["The calls helped them regain a little more genuine human contact through listening to each other’s lives."],"options":["The friends decided to replace their monthly conversations with automated greetings.","The calls helped them regain a little more genuine human contact through listening to each other’s lives.","The calls show that the friends had already been discussing their lives in detail through the stickers."]},"advanced-native-1043-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["Every online relationship is less authentic than any in-person meeting